      "id": "source-ordered-points",
      "description": "One schematic tensile stress-strain graph. Upward stress axis, rightward strain axis, origin printed as a zero/O-like glyph. No numerical ticks, unit scale, measured strain coordinates, or ruled rectangular lattice. Named curve points appear in the order O, A, B, C, D, E, K. OA is steep and approximately straight; AB rises nonlinearly; BC rises to C; CD is nearly horizontal; DE rises to the maximum E; EK drops while strain increases. K remains well above zero stress.",
